src/base-model.js holds a model trained on the DUX dataset:

  Bieber, C., Leppich, D., Harms, P. and Schubert, U. (2023). DUX: A dataset of User Interactions and User Emotions.
  Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7778612
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The model's weights were derived from that data (scripts/base_model.py). test/fixtures/base-model-windows.json holds
eight 10-second windows from DUX, converted to Orion records (key identities removed). No other part of the dataset is
redistributed. Changes: events were converted to Orion's input records and summarised into window features.
